  "about": "What the game's translation formatter (format_translation in crates/horizon-client-core/src/text.rs) makes of a template: `fields` are the argument indices it fills in, in order (null: it shows the template as written whatever the arguments), `out` what it renders with these `args` (the template as written when it refuses it). Its own test and the Python mirror in tools/lang_coverage.py both read this file, so the lang checks cannot drift from the game.",
